    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Abafilisitiya bagwanya Abisirayeli; Abisirayeli barata barahunga, kandi benshi muri bo bicirwa ku musozi Gilibowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisitiya babirukako basugereza Sawuli n’abahungu biwe, bica abahungu biwe Yonatani, Abinadabu na Maluki-Shuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Sawuli urugamba rumumerera nabi cane, abanyamiheto baramurasa baramukomeretsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawuli abwira uwari amutwaje ibigwanisho ati: “Sokora inkota yawe unsogote, kugira ngo izo ntakebwa ntizimfate ngo zinyice nabi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko uwamutwaza ibigwanisho aranka kuko yari afise ubwoba bwinshi. Nuko Sawuli afata inkota yiwe ayisukako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwe yamutwaza ibigwanisho abonye ko Sawuli apfuye, na we nyene yisuka ku nkota yiwe arapfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Sawuli n’abahungu biwe batatu barapfa, n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose bagwa hamwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bose bari mu kiyaya babonye ko ingabo zahunze kandi ko Sawuli n’abahungu biwe bapfuye, baca bata ibisagara vyabo barahunga. Maze Abafilisitiya baraza babibamwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye, Abafilisitiya baja aho urugamba rwabereye kwambura abapfuye ibigwanisho n’ibintu vyabo vy’agaciro, basanga Sawuli n’abahungu biwe baguye ku musozi Gilibowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuca umutwe, bamwambura n’ibigwanisho vyiwe, baca barungika intumwa mu gihugu cose c’Abafilisitiya ngo bakwize iyo nkuru mu ngoro z’ibigirwamana vyabo no mu bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baca bashira ibigwanisho vyiwe mu ngoro y’ibigirwamana vyabo, umutwe wiwe bawumanika mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana Dagoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ab’i Yabeshi Gileyadi bose bumvise ivyo Abafilisitiya bakoreye Sawuli vyose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abagabo bose b’abahizi baragenda batora imivyimba ya Sawuli n’abahungu biwe bayijana i Yabeshi. Bahamba amagufa yabo musi y’igiti kinini i Yabeshi, baca bisonzesha kumara imisi indwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Sawuli apfa azize kutaba umwizigirwa k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", kutazigama ijambo yabwiwe n’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " no gusiguza uwuhamagara imizimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho gusiguza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Nuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " aramwica aca agabira ingoma yiwe Dawidi mwene Isayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
